{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10100254","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10100254","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1010025401:1":{"text":"待ってください。今あなたが払ったこの銀貨、重さも色味もなんだか変ですよ。","source_cn":"等一下，你刚才给我的是什么？这银币重量和成色看着不对。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2BC019879224E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010025402:1":{"text":"それは……お、俺が麦を売って苦労して稼いだ金だ！どこが変なんだ！？","source_cn":"那是我卖……卖麦子挣的辛苦钱，哪里不对？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F829E9B344A3A01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010025403:1":{"text":"麦？先日北村で火事がありましたよね……もしかして、損失を取り戻そうと焦って、詐欺に遭ったんじゃ……？","source_cn":"麦子？北村刚刚遭受了火灾……你不会是急于挽回损失，被人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA85251748704F772","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010025404:1":{"text":"いいですか、この銀貨は偽物で、作りも雑すぎる。誰からもらったお金です？その人に抗議しないと、あなたが損をすることになりますよ！","source_cn":"听我一句，这银币是伪造的，而且工艺很拙劣。谁给你的钱？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95066AC865ECD2D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010025405:1":{"text":"な、何が偽物だ！お前の勘違いだ！金は払ったんだ、買った物は返さないからな！","source_cn":"什么假的，你认错了！钱已经付清，东西我拿走了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D27FB6DE4D5F134","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1010025406:1":{"text":"ちょっ、待ってください！","source_cn":"诶——等等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEAB1F641519A846","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1010025407:1":{"text":"ちょいと待ちな、そこの人。","source_cn":"我说，这位先生，留步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05B271D0532AAAB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1010025408:1":{"text":"あんた、あれが偽金だって気付いてただろ？誰が見ても偽物だって分かるのに、しらを切るつもりか？","source_cn":"你知道这钱是假的吧？明明是一眼就能认出来的伪造品，是想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBA3A385CDEA92C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1010025409:1":{"text":"ちっ……余計な首を突っ込むな！どけっ！","source_cn":"啧……哪来的人管闲事，快让路！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D845E4EE93474F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1010025410:1":{"text":"通貨偽造の疑いとあっちゃ、無視はできないなぁ……ブライト騎士団だ、あんたに色々聞きたいことがある、一緒に来てもらおうか。","source_cn":"涉嫌货币伪造，这事我必须得管了——耀光骑士团，请跟我走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D5412086EFDEAE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","